Package: libxslt1.1
Version: @DEB_LIBXSLT_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxslt
Depends: libxml2
Description: XSLT processing library
 libxslt provides XSLT and EXSLT processing support used by GOffice and
 Gnumeric. This iOS build disables Python bindings, crypto extensions,
 debugging support, and plugin loading.
